descriptions.zh:
该接口服务地址只能是华东 2（上海）、新加坡。
需要具备的基本权限如下：

```
{
    "Version": "1",
    "Statement": [
        {
            "Action": [
                "log:Get*"
            ],
            "Resource": [
                "acs:log:*:*:mlservice/sls_builtin_*"
            ],
            "Effect": "Allow"
        }
    ]
}
```

descriptions.en:
This API endpoint is available only in the China (Shanghai) and Singapore regions. The following basic permissions are required:

```
{
    "Version": "1",
    "Statement": [
        {
            "Action": [
                "log:Get*"
            ],
            "Resource": [
                "acs:log:*:*:mlservice/sls_builtin_*"
            ],
            "Effect": "Allow"
        }
    ]
}
```
